# The wame TUI with mocked data (no WhatsApp connection). Run ./screenshot.sh rather than this directly.
Output frames/
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1440
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "rm -f demo.db* && clear && ./wame-demo demo.db"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Type "maria"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
